Description: Firmware for Mediatek Wi-Fi, Bluetooth, and Ethernet adapters and SoCs
 This package provides firmware used by Linux kernel drivers
 btmtk, btmtk_usb, mt7601u, mt7615e, mt7622, mt7663, mt76x0,
 mt76x2e, mt76x2u, mt7915e, mt7920, mt7921, mt7922, mt7925,
